<style>
  :root {
    --font-family: "<%= (session && session.fontStyle ? String(session.fontStyle).trim() : 'Inter') %>", sans-serif;
    --primary: #01535b;
    --primary-light: #e8f4f5;
    --border: #e5e7eb;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-muted: #6b7280;
    --bg: #f9fafb;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  main {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-section {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 28px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-family: "Georgia", "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.32rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(1, 83, 91, 0.22);
    text-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .about-section p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .about-section p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .about-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .about-section li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-section li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .cta-card {
    background: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .cta-card h3 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .cta-card p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .cta-card a {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 28px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-card a:hover { opacity: 0.9; }

  .video-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding-bottom: 54%;
    height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #000;
  }

  .video-container iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
  }

  .about-section h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 24px 0 12px;
  }

  .about-section h3:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .freestyle-heading {
    font-family: var(--handwriting);
    font-size: 2.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .video-container {
      padding-bottom: 38%;
      max-width: 520px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    main { padding: 100px 20px 60px; }
    .page-header { margin: 20px 12px 40px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .about-section { padding: 20px 18px; margin: 0 12px 24px; }
    .cta-card { padding: 24px 20px; margin: 0 12px 40px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    main { padding: 110px 16px 50px; }
    .page-header { margin: 30px 8px 40px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .page-header p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .about-section { padding: 16px 14px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 8px 24px; }
    .about-section h2 { font-size: 1.02rem; }
    .about-section h3 { font-size: 0.98rem; }
    .about-section p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .about-section li { font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 20px; }
    .video-container { border-radius: 8px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .cta-card { padding: 20px 16px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 8px 40px; }
    .cta-card h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; }
    .cta-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .cta-card a { padding: 10px 22px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
  }
</style>
  
<main>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>About Managira</h1>
    <p>The Leading Secure All-in-One Educational Management Platform</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about-section">
   <h2 class="freestyle-heading">Ready?</h2>
<p>Managira is the all-in-one school management platform built for simplicity, reliability, and growth. Built by ScREAte Ltd., we empower schools with smart, practical tools that make administration effortless, secure, scalable, and transparent — so educators can focus on their students while parents and guardians monitor progress from anywhere in the world.</p>
<p>We’re ready to support the future of your school.</p>

    
