  <div class="about-section">
    <h2>The Managira Advantage</h2>
    
    <h3>Built for Daily Operations</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Organized Student Records</strong> — All student data, grades, attendance, transcripts and documents in one secure, searchable place.</li>
      <li><strong>Streamlined Admissions</strong> — Online enrollment forms, automated workflows, and faster approvals.</li>
      <li><strong>Parent Portal</strong> — Parents see progress, feedback, and who’s in charge; two-way messaging keeps families and staff aligned.</li>
      <li><strong>Multi-School Coordination</strong> — Built for large organizations and government bodies to manage every school in their network from one Hub.</li>
      <li><strong>Works Anywhere</strong> — Phones, tablets, and desktops — because school administration doesn't stop at your desk.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Designed for Every Type of Institution</h3>
<p>Purpose-built for a single school or a network of schools, Managira adapts to how you work every day.</p>
    <ul>
  <li>Primary and secondary schools</li>
  <li>Colleges, universities, and training centers</li>
  <li>Education authorities and regulatory bodies</li>
  <li>Private institutions with their own branding and identity</li>
</ul>


  <h3>Why Schools Choose Managira</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Easy setup with guided steps, walkthrough videos, and in-app support</li>
  <li>Reliable performance — built to support schools of any size</li>
  <li>Secure by design — bank-level encryption and role-based access controls</li>
  <li>Scales with you — from one school to 10,000 students and beyond</li>
  <li>24/7 real human support that understands how schools operate</li>
</ul>

  </div>
</main>

